WEBVTT

01:35.970 --> 01:38.310
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.539 --> 01:41.310
[Episode 2]

01:44.310 --> 01:44.910
Everyone,

01:45.039 --> 01:46.310
team up in groups of two.

01:46.310 --> 01:48.000
The winners can skip the 800-meter run.

01:48.000 --> 01:48.789
Pick your own partners.

01:48.789 --> 01:49.870
Pick your own partners.

01:49.870 --> 01:50.400
Pick your own partners.

01:50.400 --> 01:51.789
The winners can skip the 800-meter run!

01:51.789 --> 01:53.789
Come on, three groups for the first round.

01:53.789 --> 01:54.789
Let's come up with a chant.

01:54.789 --> 01:57.120
When we move the outside foot,
we shout "one."

01:57.120 --> 01:58.310
When we move the inside foot,
we shout "two."

01:58.310 --> 02:00.230
So it goes: one, two, one, two...

02:01.310 --> 02:03.120
Three, two, one.

02:03.150 --> 02:03.790
Go!

02:04.230 --> 02:06.150
Come on!

02:06.150 --> 02:07.510
Come on!

02:07.510 --> 02:08.400
Tong Xiaole!

02:08.430 --> 02:09.400
Come on!

02:09.520 --> 02:11.150
Come on!

02:11.240 --> 02:12.680
Come on!

02:12.750 --> 02:13.960
One, two, one, two.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.870
Awesome!

02:15.590 --> 02:17.120
-So amazing!
-Go for it!

02:19.430 --> 02:20.960
Come on, three more groups.

02:24.910 --> 02:25.710
Hurry up.

02:31.800 --> 02:33.860
I can get you out of the 800-meter run.

02:38.630 --> 02:39.360
Ready?

02:44.360 --> 02:45.760
Later you follow my call.

02:45.910 --> 02:46.910
For the outside foot, I'll shout "one."

02:46.910 --> 02:48.120
For the inside foot, I'll shout "two."

02:48.120 --> 02:50.190
Come on. Three, two, one.

02:50.190 --> 02:50.680
Run!

02:50.680 --> 02:51.470
Come on!

02:51.470 --> 02:53.030
One, two, one, two.

02:53.150 --> 02:54.430
One, two.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.750
One, two.

02:55.960 --> 02:56.960
One, two.

02:57.030 --> 02:57.870
One, two.

03:00.910 --> 03:01.800
Sorry.

03:04.080 --> 03:04.840
Are you okay?

03:19.520 --> 03:20.240
Yi Lan.

03:24.470 --> 03:25.400
You're the best!

03:25.910 --> 03:26.710
Give it to her.

03:35.360 --> 03:37.360
Sorry about what happened just now.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.260
Your stuff's blocking my view of my work.

03:48.960 --> 03:49.630
Stand up.

03:51.240 --> 03:54.240
Good morning, sir.

03:54.470 --> 03:55.240
Luo Ningzi...

03:55.240 --> 03:57.079
You're not going to defend her again,
are you?

03:57.079 --> 03:58.710
Her playing skills are just average.

03:58.710 --> 04:00.110
I'd even say they're bad.

04:00.630 --> 04:01.520
Who's bad?

04:02.400 --> 04:05.600
Just because I'm bad now
doesn't mean I'll be bad forever.

04:05.710 --> 04:06.710
Luo Ningzi.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.710
How could you say something so harsh?

04:08.710 --> 04:09.970
We're all classmates.

04:11.470 --> 04:13.000
I'm just telling the truth.

04:13.120 --> 04:13.840
Do I

04:14.240 --> 04:15.700
have to make up nice things

04:15.840 --> 04:17.190
just to make you happy?

04:19.720 --> 04:20.480
Why did you choose

04:20.480 --> 04:22.720
the third movement
of Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2

04:22.720 --> 04:24.270
as your life song?

04:27.000 --> 04:27.860
It's in A major.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.830
The melody is beautiful and melancholic.

04:29.830 --> 04:31.360
The harmonies are rich and varied.

04:31.360 --> 04:32.240
And it's one

04:32.510 --> 04:35.970
of the most poignant
and aesthetic chapters in music history.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.120
Is that it?

04:41.950 --> 04:43.040
Leningrad was being bombed

04:43.040 --> 04:45.159
with hundreds of tons
of explosives every day.

04:45.159 --> 04:46.510
To pull people through,

04:46.800 --> 04:48.120
musicians performed this symphony

04:48.120 --> 04:50.120
for the first time right there in the war.

04:50.120 --> 04:52.650
It made everyone believe
that they would win.

04:52.680 --> 04:54.140
That is the power of music.

04:55.800 --> 04:58.120
That's why I tear up whenever I hear it.

04:59.800 --> 05:01.270
It's my life song too.

05:02.390 --> 05:03.950
I thought that having the same life song,

05:03.950 --> 05:05.880
we'd feel the same way about music.

05:06.390 --> 05:08.390
But that doesn't seem to be the case.

05:09.120 --> 05:11.450
Since you don't want to be friends
with me,

05:12.040 --> 05:14.370
I don't want to be friends
with you either.

05:19.390 --> 05:20.240
Faster.

05:27.800 --> 05:28.600
You know what?

05:29.510 --> 05:32.680
Joining the school orchestra
requires applying a month in advance.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.680
Because you suddenly transferred here,

05:34.680 --> 05:36.920
not only did you humiliate Yi Lan
in front of everyone,

05:36.920 --> 05:39.510
but you also made her lose her chance
to audition.

05:39.510 --> 05:41.370
Yet she didn't get angry about it.

05:41.720 --> 05:43.680
Instead, she recognized your ability

05:43.680 --> 05:44.740
and respected you.

05:45.680 --> 05:46.680
But in my opinion,

05:47.240 --> 05:48.570
your attitude right now

05:48.830 --> 05:50.690
doesn't deserve to be respected.

05:53.120 --> 05:54.920
This... I think

05:55.680 --> 05:57.240
she meant to give it to you.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.120
No wonder she doesn't have any friends.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.390
You all look so lifeless.

06:16.430 --> 06:18.430
It's time to switch seats, isn't it?

06:20.390 --> 06:22.920
Groups 1 to 4 switch seats
with Groups 5 to 8.

06:23.600 --> 06:24.310
Luo Ningzi,

06:24.800 --> 06:25.950
you should be

06:26.240 --> 06:26.840
in Group 5.

06:27.720 --> 06:28.600
Five minutes!

06:29.360 --> 06:30.490
Hurry up and switch!

06:30.830 --> 06:32.030
Ning, let me help you.

06:33.630 --> 06:34.920
You leg is injured.

06:38.480 --> 06:41.480
You're in Group Five,
so you'll be Xiaole's deskmate.

06:42.310 --> 06:42.909
Thank you.

06:52.360 --> 06:53.159
Hi, deskmate.

06:53.310 --> 06:54.070
Hi, deskmate.

06:54.070 --> 06:54.380
Hi.

06:54.409 --> 06:54.750
Hi.

06:54.770 --> 06:55.120
Hi.

06:55.140 --> 06:55.520
Hi.

06:55.540 --> 06:56.040
Hi.

07:04.160 --> 07:05.620
Are you free after school?

07:05.920 --> 07:07.450
I want to ask you something.

07:08.390 --> 07:08.830
Okay.

07:17.800 --> 07:18.600
Traitor.

07:29.270 --> 07:31.270
I'll wait for you at the school gate.

07:46.680 --> 07:47.340
Shall we go?

07:47.720 --> 07:48.580
School's over.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.720
Aren't you going with your new friend?

07:51.720 --> 07:53.520
So... you're not coming with us?

07:54.000 --> 07:56.200
What would I do there while you two chat?

07:57.270 --> 07:57.930
Good point.

07:59.430 --> 08:00.160
I'm off then.

08:00.360 --> 08:00.920
Go ahead.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.720
You said it.

08:03.270 --> 08:03.750
Yeah.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.240
I'm leaving then.

08:07.510 --> 08:08.240
Bye.

08:09.800 --> 08:10.950
My new friend!

08:11.160 --> 08:12.160
My new friend!

08:12.360 --> 08:13.360
My new friend!

08:18.160 --> 08:19.560
He's got a new friend now?

08:21.680 --> 08:23.830
Do those two have some kind of secret?

08:27.120 --> 08:27.850
Come with me.

08:32.360 --> 08:34.080
Later, let's go eat malatang together.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.200
My treat.

08:42.789 --> 08:44.049
Can you slow down a bit?

08:46.600 --> 08:47.600
Is your foot okay?

08:48.390 --> 08:48.990
It's fine.

08:50.480 --> 08:51.480
I can't hear them.

08:53.030 --> 08:55.030
When did those two get so close?

08:55.240 --> 08:57.200
They're even going home together now.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.330
Why should I believe

08:58.600 --> 08:59.660
what you just said?

09:00.360 --> 09:00.960
I mean

09:01.480 --> 09:02.870
why I should believe

09:03.000 --> 09:04.400
that I took Yi Lan's spot.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.280
The school orchestra

09:14.550 --> 09:16.600
is basically run by students.

09:17.200 --> 09:18.660
If you don't believe this,

09:19.440 --> 09:20.640
you can go ask anyone.

09:23.480 --> 09:25.000
Why aren't you this impatient

09:25.000 --> 09:26.320
when you talk to them?

09:28.000 --> 09:30.200
The way I talk makes you uncomfortable?

09:31.080 --> 09:31.810
That's good.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.150
At least now

09:33.360 --> 09:35.120
you know how Yi Lan felt.

09:37.200 --> 09:37.960
Childish.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.330
Are you okay?

09:53.600 --> 09:54.600
Yi Lan, Mengmeng,

09:54.600 --> 09:55.600
what are you doing here?

09:55.600 --> 09:57.660
You disappeared right after school.

10:04.320 --> 10:06.000
Mengmeng insisted on coming here

10:06.000 --> 10:07.000
to enjoy the view.

10:07.200 --> 10:08.330
What's there to see?

10:09.480 --> 10:10.480
It's really nice.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.440
What were you and Mengmeng

10:18.440 --> 10:20.170
furtively looking at just now?

10:22.320 --> 10:23.780
We were enjoying the view.

10:25.000 --> 10:26.080
The view?

10:27.750 --> 10:29.810
What's so nice to look at around here?

10:31.240 --> 10:32.200
It's quite nice.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.690
What does it have to do with you?

10:36.240 --> 10:37.320
Are you mad?

10:39.080 --> 10:40.480
Why would I be mad?

10:40.550 --> 10:41.240
I'm not mad.

10:43.750 --> 10:45.320
I'm not mad!

10:46.000 --> 10:46.630
Fine.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.320
If you're not mad,

10:49.440 --> 10:50.000
get on the bike.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.800
Let's go home.

10:54.630 --> 10:55.510
I have legs.

10:55.750 --> 10:56.880
I can walk by myself.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.870
You think those two legs of yours

10:58.870 --> 11:00.730
can run faster than my two wheels?

11:01.000 --> 11:01.550
Hurry up.

11:02.630 --> 11:03.870
Leave me alone.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.490
I can walk by myself.

11:06.320 --> 11:07.920
You still say you're not mad?

11:08.080 --> 11:09.200
You're clearly mad.

11:09.200 --> 11:11.200
I said I'm not mad!

11:12.000 --> 11:14.730
Can you stop making conversation
out of nothing?

11:15.870 --> 11:16.600
Fine.

11:23.240 --> 11:26.200
When did you

11:26.510 --> 11:27.970
get so close to Luo Ningzi?

11:28.480 --> 11:30.200
You know things between her and me
are awkward.

11:30.200 --> 11:32.200
You're betraying me, you know that?

11:35.320 --> 11:37.520
Do you still want to play cello with her?

11:42.600 --> 11:44.440
What does it have to do with you?

11:48.000 --> 11:48.390
Yeah.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.930
It indeed has nothing to do with me.

11:51.670 --> 11:53.200
Walk home by yourself then.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.900
You're actually leaving?

12:08.080 --> 12:10.280
Do you still want to play cello with her?

12:20.480 --> 12:21.870
It's lunch break, right?

12:21.870 --> 12:23.670
Alright, arrange your own time.

12:23.720 --> 12:24.510
Don't erase the blackboard.

12:24.510 --> 12:26.640
We'll continue this afternoon, okay?

12:27.030 --> 12:28.120
Don't run around!

12:30.320 --> 12:31.320
Class dismissed.

12:32.120 --> 12:32.850
Come with me.

12:33.030 --> 12:34.160
I need to talk to you.

12:39.550 --> 12:40.950
Go eat by yourself first.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.700
Qiao Mengmeng.

12:59.630 --> 13:00.360
You lost.

13:00.440 --> 13:01.000
That doesn't count.

13:01.000 --> 13:02.000
Let's do it again.

13:08.840 --> 13:11.100
Zhao Zhenghao, let me ask you something.

13:11.120 --> 13:12.960
Are there auditions
for the school orchestra?

13:12.960 --> 13:15.000
Why did you cancel Yi Lan's audition?

13:15.000 --> 13:15.860
What audition?

13:21.630 --> 13:22.120
Don't tell me

13:22.120 --> 13:24.240
you're actually sympathizing with her.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.300
It's not sympathy.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.880
I want to compete fairly,

13:27.080 --> 13:28.410
even if she still loses.

13:33.840 --> 13:35.870
There's no such thing as fair competition.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.960
I decide who it is!

13:39.600 --> 13:41.060
Since you're the captain,

13:41.080 --> 13:43.610
you should consider
your members' opinions.

13:43.870 --> 13:44.600
Besides,

13:44.870 --> 13:46.470
I was just nervous last time.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.200
If you've got the guts,

13:48.200 --> 13:49.440
let me play again.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.770
Otherwise, I'll leave too.

13:54.550 --> 13:56.200
Then let's just set another time.

13:56.200 --> 13:56.720
Right?

13:58.870 --> 13:59.440
Fine.

14:00.200 --> 14:01.720
Since you want to prove yourself so badly,

14:01.720 --> 14:03.380
I'll give you another chance.

14:03.440 --> 14:06.300
Next Monday,
see you in the music room after school.

14:10.360 --> 14:11.200
Thanks.

14:20.480 --> 14:21.440
After school.

14:21.630 --> 14:23.030
See you in the music room.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.480
See you in the music room.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.600
Why are you smiling so happily?

14:36.360 --> 14:38.290
I'm happy whenever you're around.

14:43.000 --> 14:43.930
The basketball!

14:58.000 --> 14:58.600
Xiaole!

15:02.080 --> 15:03.080
So you're at home.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.440
Why didn't you answer the phone?

15:04.440 --> 15:05.900
I called you so many times.

15:06.320 --> 15:07.250
I didn't hear it.

15:12.200 --> 15:13.060
Move over a bit.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.750
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

15:17.750 --> 15:18.360
No.

15:21.960 --> 15:23.360
I'll cook for you in a bit.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.880
I need to rest for a while.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.440
Mom, I'm going out.

15:53.630 --> 15:55.290
Why are you so inconsiderate?

15:55.750 --> 15:57.600
It's already this late,
and you're still going out?

15:57.600 --> 15:59.660
Your mom just said she'd cook for you!

16:01.550 --> 16:02.440
Are you mute?

16:03.000 --> 16:03.860
Say something!

16:06.320 --> 16:06.790
Oh.

16:07.480 --> 16:09.080
What kind of attitude is that?

16:09.080 --> 16:10.870
You never answer your mom's calls!

16:10.870 --> 16:13.070
Do you know how worried she was just now?

16:13.360 --> 16:13.750
Alright, alright.

16:13.750 --> 16:15.680
You always make such a mess at home.

16:15.750 --> 16:18.000
Every time your mom has to clean it up
after she gets home!

16:18.000 --> 16:19.000
It's fine, really.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.060
Alright, alright.

16:20.720 --> 16:21.550
Give it a rest.

16:21.630 --> 16:22.440
Give it a rest?

16:22.550 --> 16:24.200
Today, I'm going to let him know

16:24.200 --> 16:25.080
that I am his father!

16:25.080 --> 16:26.240
He can't just do whatever he wants

16:26.240 --> 16:27.200
in this family!

16:27.320 --> 16:29.000
So you do remember you're my father!

16:29.000 --> 16:30.200
All you care about is your lousy money!

16:30.200 --> 16:31.550
Have you ever cared about me?

16:31.550 --> 16:33.320
Have you ever been
to my parent-teacher conferences?

16:33.320 --> 16:34.720
Have you ever cared
about what I do

16:34.720 --> 16:35.980
or what I eat at school?

16:36.200 --> 16:36.720
Look at yourself!

16:36.720 --> 16:37.870
What right do you have to lecture me?

16:37.870 --> 16:39.270
Because I'm your father!

16:39.360 --> 16:41.320
I work my ass off to support this family!

16:41.320 --> 16:42.650
This is how you repay me?

16:43.320 --> 16:44.360
Stop it.

16:44.870 --> 16:45.480
Stop it.

16:45.720 --> 16:46.240
Just get out.

16:46.240 --> 16:46.700
Get out.

16:47.630 --> 16:48.890
Who are you glaring at?

16:48.960 --> 16:50.160
You ungrateful brat!

17:56.840 --> 18:04.860
[Come get some fried chicken, same place]
[Come quickly!]

18:04.890 --> 18:08.470
[Okay]

18:39.070 --> 18:40.600
It's really boring, Yi Lan.

18:41.790 --> 18:43.270
You're so boring.

18:45.550 --> 18:47.110
How come you started eating without me?

18:47.110 --> 18:48.110
It smells so good.

18:48.270 --> 18:49.030
Try one.

18:49.350 --> 18:50.310
Have a bite!

18:55.920 --> 18:56.920
Are you okay?

18:58.270 --> 18:58.830
I'm good.

18:59.030 --> 18:59.750
I'm great.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.590
He picks on me
every time he comes home anyway.

19:01.590 --> 19:02.400
I'm used to it.

19:06.000 --> 19:06.830
It's okay.

19:06.830 --> 19:07.920
Don't be upset.

19:09.590 --> 19:10.550
Your hands are all greasy.

19:10.550 --> 19:11.550
So what?

19:14.000 --> 19:16.070
Just come to me whenever you're unhappy.

19:16.070 --> 19:16.830
Don't keep it to yourself.

19:16.830 --> 19:17.890
I'll stay with you.

19:19.030 --> 19:19.490
Really?

19:19.510 --> 19:20.030
Yeah.

19:23.110 --> 19:24.270
What are you doing?

19:24.510 --> 19:25.570
You're in trouble!

20:10.110 --> 20:11.310
Xiaole, you're back.

20:12.110 --> 20:12.970
Yeah, I'm back.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.110
Mom, I'm going to sleep.

20:14.110 --> 20:15.160
You should rest early too.

20:15.160 --> 20:15.830
Okay.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.550
I'm here!

20:44.880 --> 20:46.030
Didn't you say you were going
to do homework?

20:46.030 --> 20:48.090
Why are you carrying your cello case?

20:48.350 --> 20:50.310
I obviously need to practice hard.

20:50.310 --> 20:52.550
I have to do well
at the school orchestra audition.

20:52.550 --> 20:53.400
Fine.

20:54.030 --> 20:55.000
Aren't you gonna help me carry it?

20:55.000 --> 20:56.460
Just toss it in the basket.

21:11.350 --> 21:12.810
There's some weird noise.

21:15.790 --> 21:17.050
Let me check it for you.

21:18.200 --> 21:18.930
Give it to me.

21:19.920 --> 21:20.750
Make yourself comfortable.

21:20.750 --> 21:22.550
Someone's practicing in there.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.440
She doesn't even need the sheet music.

21:45.440 --> 21:46.700
Pretty talented, huh?

21:49.830 --> 21:50.920
Leave your cello here.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.780
I'll let you know when it's fixed.

21:53.070 --> 21:53.680
Thanks.

21:53.790 --> 21:54.450
No problem.

21:54.590 --> 21:55.350
Take care.

21:56.190 --> 21:59.000
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

21:59.050 --> 22:00.490
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

21:59.200 --> 21:59.790
This girl

22:00.730 --> 22:03.530
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

22:00.790 --> 22:02.320
doesn't even like to smile.

22:03.970 --> 22:07.920
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

22:08.870 --> 22:10.520
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

22:10.540 --> 22:12.190
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

22:12.220 --> 22:15.440
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

22:15.910 --> 22:17.400
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

22:17.420 --> 22:19.500
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

22:19.930 --> 22:22.650
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

22:22.790 --> 22:24.170
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

22:24.500 --> 22:25.990
♪ And I run towards you ♪

22:26.130 --> 22:29.480
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

22:29.640 --> 22:31.070
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

22:31.260 --> 22:33.370
♪ To build a castle ♪

22:33.720 --> 22:36.010
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

22:36.070 --> 22:37.830
Lan, that was beautiful!

22:36.130 --> 22:38.600
♪ Let me find you ♪

22:41.070 --> 22:42.070
Thanks.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.070
Why work so hard?

22:45.070 --> 22:46.590
You'll lose to Luo Ningzi anyway.

22:46.590 --> 22:47.720
Shut your trap.

22:48.200 --> 22:49.350
I was just joking.

22:51.000 --> 22:52.070
Anyway, I just need to show

22:52.070 --> 22:53.830
my true ability.

22:53.960 --> 22:55.490
I don't care about the rest.

25:14.590 --> 25:16.190
That's just beginner level.

25:17.350 --> 25:18.200
With this,

25:18.750 --> 25:20.880
she can get into our school orchestra?

25:21.070 --> 25:21.920
Indeed.

25:22.110 --> 25:24.110
Yi Lan, your level...

25:26.830 --> 25:28.360
What do you say, Luo Ningzi?

25:34.920 --> 25:36.450
Her understanding of music

25:36.920 --> 25:38.200
is more than qualified

25:39.110 --> 25:40.640
for your school orchestra.

25:41.790 --> 25:42.590
What do you mean,

25:42.590 --> 25:43.250
Luo Ningzi?

25:44.350 --> 25:45.270
It's okay.

25:45.830 --> 25:48.110
I know everyone's really good.

25:48.550 --> 25:49.680
I don't care

25:50.310 --> 25:53.110
if I can make it
into the school orchestra anymore.

25:59.680 --> 26:01.610
Zhao Zhenghao, you're such a jerk!

26:04.830 --> 26:05.110
Let's go.

26:05.110 --> 26:05.970
Zhao Zhenghao.

26:06.350 --> 26:08.510
The school orchestra
doesn't belong to you alone.

26:08.510 --> 26:09.350
If the school orchestra

26:09.350 --> 26:11.200
is full of people like you
who don't respect music

26:11.200 --> 26:12.200
and are arrogant,

26:12.830 --> 26:13.590
then I don't see

26:13.590 --> 26:15.720
any point in this orchestra existing.

26:22.750 --> 26:24.070
I... I didn't mean it.

26:31.110 --> 26:32.970
Everyone, just keep practicing.

26:45.790 --> 26:46.510
Sorry.

26:54.920 --> 26:55.550
Mengmeng,

26:55.550 --> 26:57.310
isn't this a bit too much?

26:57.590 --> 26:59.030
You even got me a wheelchair.

26:59.030 --> 26:59.790
Absolutely.

26:59.790 --> 27:01.850
I'm terrified you'll get hurt again.

27:02.030 --> 27:02.830
But Lan,

27:02.830 --> 27:05.690
why didn't you join the school orchestra
in the end?

27:06.110 --> 27:07.910
Luo Ningzi is indeed excellent.

27:08.110 --> 27:09.750
But at least I've proved to her

27:09.750 --> 27:11.830
that I'm not that bad. And that's enough.

27:11.830 --> 27:12.510
Fine.

27:12.550 --> 27:14.550
Anyway, you're the best in my heart.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.350
You are so sweet, Mengmeng.

27:16.350 --> 27:17.790
Of course, Lan.

27:19.000 --> 27:19.790
Why does it take so long

27:19.790 --> 27:21.920
for Chen Fan and Xiaole to buy skewers?

27:34.550 --> 27:35.920
What exactly do you want?

27:35.920 --> 27:37.580
Why are you always against me?

27:38.590 --> 27:39.270
Don't tell me you want

27:39.270 --> 27:41.600
to be the captain of the school orchestra.

27:45.350 --> 27:47.110
I knew that was your plan.

27:47.590 --> 27:50.250
You wanted to humiliate me
in front of everyone.

27:54.070 --> 27:55.550
Are you questioning me?

27:55.920 --> 27:57.050
Let me tell you this.

27:57.110 --> 28:00.310
Without me, the school orchestra
wouldn't be what it is today.

28:00.310 --> 28:01.830
I worked my ass off

28:02.030 --> 28:04.830
to get every single instrument
in this orchestra.

28:05.440 --> 28:06.790
To me, the orchestra

28:07.110 --> 28:08.550
is my territory

28:09.110 --> 28:10.160
and my king!

28:14.510 --> 28:15.350
My kingdom!

28:23.510 --> 28:25.310
How can you be so disrespectful?

28:30.110 --> 28:31.070
Luo Ningzi?

28:31.680 --> 28:32.310
Let's go.

28:32.590 --> 28:33.720
Let's go have a look.

28:34.350 --> 28:35.590
I am talking to you!

28:40.920 --> 28:42.250
Stop it, Zhao Zhenghao!

28:42.830 --> 28:43.510
Mengmeng.

28:46.790 --> 28:48.050
You called for backup?

28:48.110 --> 28:50.030
Zhao Zhenghao, I'm warning you.

28:50.110 --> 28:51.110
Don't think just because we're off campus,

28:51.110 --> 28:52.110
you can do whatever you want.

28:52.110 --> 28:52.750
Exactly!

28:53.110 --> 28:54.830
I never laid my hands on girls.

28:55.550 --> 28:57.160
But you've gone too far.

28:57.920 --> 28:59.980
You're practically forcing my hand.

29:02.440 --> 29:03.500
What are you doing?

29:04.350 --> 29:04.810
This...

29:05.000 --> 29:05.930
Is anyone there?

29:06.000 --> 29:06.920
Help!

29:07.680 --> 29:09.200
-Help!
-Let go of her!

29:22.110 --> 29:22.680
What kind of man

29:22.680 --> 29:24.200
picks on three girls?

29:24.750 --> 29:26.610
What does this have to do with you?

29:26.830 --> 29:28.110
Mind your own business.

29:28.110 --> 29:29.710
Of course it has to do with me.

29:29.830 --> 29:32.070
They're all under my protection.

29:32.510 --> 29:34.770
When you mess with them, you mess with me.

29:36.790 --> 29:37.350
Fine.

29:38.510 --> 29:40.350
Then let's fight like real men.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.440
For real?

29:50.790 --> 29:51.250
Come on.

29:51.790 --> 29:52.310
Come on.

30:00.310 --> 30:00.770
Come on.

30:00.830 --> 30:01.290
Come on.

30:04.830 --> 30:05.560
He's so weak.

30:07.110 --> 30:07.680
Captain Zhao!

30:07.680 --> 30:08.680
Zhenghao!

30:09.270 --> 30:09.830
Zhenghao!

30:09.830 --> 30:10.430
Zhenghao!

30:11.350 --> 30:12.240
Help me up.

30:14.030 --> 30:14.680
Run!

30:16.070 --> 30:16.750
Hurry!

30:16.830 --> 30:18.510
Guys, what took you so long?

30:19.200 --> 30:20.060
Where are they?

30:20.200 --> 30:21.060
Where are they?

30:21.830 --> 30:23.360
They called for backup too?

30:26.550 --> 30:27.950
Zhenghao, they ran away.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.400
Should we chase them?

30:29.830 --> 30:30.510
Of course!

30:30.920 --> 30:31.580
After them!

30:31.590 --> 30:31.990
Quick!

30:33.200 --> 30:33.830
Director Hu,

30:33.830 --> 30:34.750
it's them!

30:34.790 --> 30:35.520
Director Hu,

30:36.510 --> 30:37.510
they're bullying us.

30:37.510 --> 30:38.070
Are you okay?

30:38.070 --> 30:38.600
It's him!

30:39.510 --> 30:40.830
You little brats,

30:41.350 --> 30:42.110
stop right there!

30:42.110 --> 30:43.350
You punks!

30:44.310 --> 30:44.920
Which class are you from?

30:44.920 --> 30:46.200
Don't let me catch you!

30:46.350 --> 30:47.350
Stop right there!

30:52.200 --> 30:53.060
Zhao Zhenghao!

30:55.310 --> 30:56.310
Stop right there!

31:08.110 --> 31:09.370
Tong Xiaole, Chen Fan!

31:10.750 --> 31:11.610
Come over here.

31:13.590 --> 31:14.520
And you guys too?

31:18.310 --> 31:18.910
Mengmeng,

31:18.920 --> 31:20.200
you're such a traitor.

31:20.200 --> 31:21.680
You ran off by yourself.

31:21.830 --> 31:23.830
I just went to get help.

31:28.110 --> 31:29.400
Look at you two.

31:29.550 --> 31:31.280
Did you really become besties?

31:32.310 --> 31:33.070
Luo Ningzi.

31:33.350 --> 31:35.350
Although you don't like making friends,

31:35.350 --> 31:37.200
you're still a good friend.

31:42.200 --> 31:44.000
Can I invite you

31:44.070 --> 31:46.590
to practice cello with me after school?

31:49.720 --> 31:51.790
After school, I usually

31:51.790 --> 31:54.450
practice in the school music room
for two hours.

31:55.440 --> 31:56.030
Oh.

31:58.720 --> 32:00.110
But the school doesn't say

32:00.110 --> 32:02.040
only orchestra members can use it.

32:04.550 --> 32:06.880
Then let's practice together from now on.

32:11.270 --> 32:11.870
Together!

32:15.590 --> 32:16.120
Let's go.

32:21.310 --> 32:21.920
Director,

32:22.310 --> 32:23.310
it was him.

32:23.350 --> 32:24.270
He led

32:24.440 --> 32:24.960
them...

32:25.310 --> 32:26.070
these guys...

32:26.070 --> 32:27.800
They cornered us after school.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.000
And my leg

32:29.070 --> 32:29.730
got injured

32:30.160 --> 32:31.020
because of him.

32:32.270 --> 32:33.350
It had nothing to do with those two?

32:33.350 --> 32:33.790
Nothing!

32:33.790 --> 32:34.650
Nothing at all.

32:35.830 --> 32:36.360
Alright.

32:37.070 --> 32:38.600
I've got the whole picture.

32:39.000 --> 32:40.260
Tong Xiaole, Chen Fan,

32:40.310 --> 32:41.510
you two are innocent.

32:41.790 --> 32:42.390
You can go.

32:42.680 --> 32:43.590
Thank you, Director.

32:43.590 --> 32:44.790
Thank you, Director.

32:44.830 --> 32:46.030
Director, then we...

32:46.110 --> 32:46.710
You can go.

32:52.880 --> 32:53.610
Stand still!

32:55.830 --> 32:57.830
You guys like causing trouble, huh?

32:58.110 --> 32:58.590
Fine.

32:59.640 --> 33:01.000
As your punishment,
you'll clean the toilets

33:01.000 --> 33:01.790
for a week!

33:03.440 --> 33:04.640
Try playing it first.

33:04.680 --> 33:05.810
Let me take a listen.

33:16.750 --> 33:17.270
Stop.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.170
Count the beat in your head.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.260
You have to keep up.

33:24.270 --> 33:24.950
Da, da, da, da.

33:24.950 --> 33:25.540
Da, da, da, da.

33:25.540 --> 33:26.150
Da, da, da, da.

33:26.150 --> 33:26.950
Da, da, da, da.

33:27.270 --> 33:28.530
Keep the tempo steady.

33:28.680 --> 33:30.270
Five, six, seven, go!

33:30.720 --> 33:31.400
Da, da, da, da.

33:31.400 --> 33:32.000
Da, da, da, da.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.690
Da, da, da, da.

33:32.690 --> 33:33.440
Da, da, da, da.

33:33.440 --> 33:33.830
Stop.

33:36.070 --> 33:37.550
You're falling behind the tempo a bit.

33:37.550 --> 33:39.750
You might need to practice more at home.

33:41.440 --> 33:43.200
Separate your second and third fingers
a bit more.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.330
Curve your fingers.

33:47.200 --> 33:47.680
Stop.

33:49.070 --> 33:51.350
You still need more practice at home.

34:22.880 --> 34:23.440
What?

34:24.070 --> 34:24.760
Give me one.

34:25.070 --> 34:26.130
This is not for you.

34:26.190 --> 34:27.670
You have so many,
but I can't even have one?

34:27.670 --> 34:28.760
Haven't you eaten enough?

34:28.760 --> 34:29.290
Get lost.

34:34.150 --> 34:35.800
Then it must be for me.

34:38.590 --> 34:39.920
It's not for you either.

34:41.550 --> 34:42.550
Then who is it for?

34:42.710 --> 34:44.190
It's for Ning.

34:44.510 --> 34:45.670
Ning?

34:46.320 --> 34:47.760
You call her Ning?

34:48.920 --> 34:51.250
This morning you called me Qiao Mengmeng!

34:51.670 --> 34:52.400
Mengmeng.

34:52.480 --> 34:53.080
Mengmeng.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.580
She's your new friend?

34:57.630 --> 34:59.190
She is my new friend,

34:59.550 --> 35:01.150
but you are my best friend.

35:01.150 --> 35:02.000
It's different.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.600
Then where does a best friend

35:04.510 --> 35:05.550
rank?

35:06.000 --> 35:07.670
Ranked first.

35:07.800 --> 35:08.480
First.

35:11.550 --> 35:12.400
Only one.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.760
Ning.

35:19.510 --> 35:21.150
This nougat is really good.

35:21.400 --> 35:22.130
It's for you.

35:24.630 --> 35:25.360
Thanks.

35:28.320 --> 35:28.920
This is

35:29.710 --> 35:30.170
for you.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.780
It's also a collector's edition.

35:36.490 --> 35:38.910
[Rachmaninoff's Symphony No. 2]
